re  that would bother me if they decided not  to  there's a couple words i'd have for him  but  [Laughter]  it wouldn't kill me  in addition to the big leagues spin lift  ships mud to many minor league college  and even high school teams as well the  latter can get by on one small 25 jar  per season  for most of his life jim worked as a  short order cook  his dad was a carpenter his grandfather  a baker  but this unique family side hustle has  managed to sprinkle a dusting of the  bent lifts onto the fingertips and bat  barrels of every baseball moment you're  likely to remember does this still  register to you when something big in  the sport happens  guy hits a record-breaking home run wins  the world series yeah that your mud's on  the ball yeah  yeah that's why i do it  i ain't getting richier that's why i do  it

